<title>UK: SuedwestLB unit sets $150 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB unit sets $150 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTLB CAPITAL MARKETS</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    26.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  89.19     PAY DATE  L-24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    89.19     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
